        },
        {
          "text": "Siku nyingi nimenyamaza kimya; nimenyamaza, nikajizuia; sasa nitapiga kelele kama mwanamke aliye katika kuzaa; nitaugua na kutweta pamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitaharibu milima na vilima, nitavikausha vyote vimeavyo; nitaifanya mito ya maji kuwa visiwa, na kuyakausha maziwa ya maji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawaleta vipofu kwa njia wasiyoijua; katika mapito wasiyoyajua nitawaongoza; nitafanya giza kuwa nuru mbele yao; na mahali palipopotoka kuwa pamenyoka. Haya nitayatenda, wala sitawaacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watarudishwa nyuma, wataaibishwa sana, hao wanaotumainia sanamu za mawe, na kuziambia sanamu za madini, Ninyi ndinyi miungu yetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
